    "detailed_description": "<h1>The Villain Protagonist Bundle</h1><p>Do you enjoy being the bad guy? You can spill even more blood now with our Villain Protagonist Bundle!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473870/extras/5e46f7787e5b775f668213058c06ef49.avif?t=1649774786\" /></div></p><br><h1>Check out more games!</h1><p><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473870/extras/180be6868b13766686967fceb863480d.avif?t=1649774786\" /></div><br>Hell Loop is a platformer tower defense game, unlike any other tower defense game you know. You are not defending anything valuable. You are torturing sinners who are continually marching, one by one in a long streak, trying to evade their punishment. <br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473870/extras/4aae1649d0612a4a853cf4cb43b1de76.poster.avif?t=1649774786\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473870/extras/4aae1649d0612a4a853cf4cb43b1de76.webm?t=1649774786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473870/extras/4aae1649d0612a4a853cf4cb43b1de76.mp4?t=1649774786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473870/extras/50dab77f84306ca6aa9eab41bbae1682.avif?t=1649774786\" /></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473870/extras/2a1f4290b3c9b0658c2c89dfe3e3522a.poster.avif?t=1649774786\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473870/extras/2a1f4290b3c9b0658c2c89dfe3e3522a.mp4?t=1649774786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Select from a random subset of available traps - get each game a different choice!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473870/extras/c1bc188fbc4a91384d7000ada7a397ee.poster.avif?t=1649774786\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473870/extras/c1bc188fbc4a91384d7000ada7a397ee.webm?t=1649774786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473870/extras/c1bc188fbc4a91384d7000ada7a397ee.mp4?t=1649774786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Place traps carefully across the level - you can do it in pause mode or in real-time<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473870/extras/8fe52896498532cd562cc26734f8c9f8.poster.avif?t=1649774786\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473870/extras/8fe52896498532cd562cc26734f8c9f8.webm?t=1649774786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473870/extras/8fe52896498532cd562cc26734f8c9f8.mp4?t=1649774786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Watch the bloodshed and upgrade traps<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473870/extras/bf036fb10f62b88f546eb49d58b75621.poster.avif?t=1649774786\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473870/extras/bf036fb10f62b88f546eb49d58b75621.webm?t=1649774786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473870/extras/bf036fb10f62b88f546eb49d58b75621.mp4?t=1649774786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Manage your resources of blood - upgrades and placing traps cost blood, kills earns blood<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473870/extras/f0cf1dca52b05fb5969a2179906a6031.poster.avif?t=1649774786\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473870/extras/f0cf1dca52b05fb5969a2179906a6031.webm?t=1649774786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473870/extras/f0cf1dca52b05fb5969a2179906a6031.mp4?t=1649774786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Take into account the passive modifiers for the game - they can be both positive and negative!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1473870/extras/4f399b253687a311075718e0391e98f4.avif?t=1649774786\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Tower defense meets platformer - a unique combo with a pinch of good old Lemmings vibe (only the Lemmings were cute, our humans are not).<br></li><li> Hand-crafted levels with unique challenges. After all who says that hell is only fire and lava. A sinner can very well be tortured in acid or put to work in mines!<br></li><li> Select wisely when given the option, as new traps will not come every level.<br></li><li> Be aware of game-changing modifiers.<br></li><li> Calculate with your blood, every drop of it is important. Killing human grants you a few extra drops.<br></li><li> Don't forget to upgrade your traps! No one said being the hell manager is easy.&quot;\t<br></li><li> Steam achievements &amp; leaderboard!\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li></ul>",
